flowchart TB
    call[Need a model call] --> b{Budget left?}
    b -- no --> stop[Stop and say so]
    b -- yes --> g{Concurrency<br/>slot free?}
    g -- no --> w[Wait]
    w --> g
    g -- yes --> r[Make the call]
    r --> ok{Success?}
    ok -- yes --> done[Count it, continue]
    ok -- blip --> rt[Retry a couple of times]
    rt --> r